    <system:String x:Key="MDataGridFilterExpressionGenericExamples"  xml:space="preserve">Generic filter examples:
       
    apple ⟶ Any column contains apple ignore case
    apple* ⟶ Any column starts with apple
    *apple ⟶ Any column ends with apple
    "apple" ⟶ Any column equals apple
        
AND, OR and NOT and parentheses are also supported:

    apple AND banana ⟶ Some column has apple and some has banana
    apple OR banana ⟶ Any column has apple or banana
    NOT apple* ⟶ No column starts with apple
    (apple OR banana) AND NOT juice ⟶ Any of them but not juice
        
Column comparision is also supported:

    [Stock] >=10 AND [Stock] &lt; 20
    [Stock] &lt; [Min. Stock]
    [Package] = "TO-92"
    [Mount] &lt;> "THT"
    </system:String>

    <system:String x:Key="MDataGridFilterExpressionColumnExamples"  xml:space="preserve">Column filter examples:
       
    apple ⟶ Column contains apple ignore case
    apple* ⟶ Column starts with apple
    *apple ⟶ Column ends with apple
    "apple" ⟶ Column exact match apple
    "" ⟶ Column is empty
        
AND, OR and NOT and parentheses are also supported:

    apple AND banana ⟶ Column contains both
    apple OR banana ⟶ Column contains any of them
    apple OR "" ⟶ Column contain apple or it is empty
    NOT apple* ⟶ Column doesn't starts with apple
    (apple OR banana) AND NOT juice ⟶ Any of them but not juice 
    NOT "" ⟶ Column is not empty
    </system:String>
    
